---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Amber Uncut"
  description="Faith, family, and hair, served straight up. Amber is a men's barber, a small-town Texas girl, and the owner of a brand-new salon."
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main>
    <article class="full-story" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="story-kicker"><span>ABOUT</span><span>AMBER UNCUT</span></div>
      <h1 id="about-title">Faith, family and <em>hair.</em></h1>
      <img class="story-page-image" src="/assets/Amber_Uncut.jpeg" alt="Amber smiling in a pink shirt" />
      <div class="full-story-copy">
        <p>
          I'm a men's barber, a small-town Texas girl, and the owner of a brand-new salon built from
          grit, faith, and a whole lot of winging it. I've been in the grooming game for 13 years,
          working everywhere from commercial shops to booth rentals while bouncing through four
          cities for my husband's career. He handles the business and legal headaches. I handle the
          hair &mdash; and the chaos.
        </p>
        <p>
          Amber Uncut is where I get to be real. No filter. No corporate talk. No pretending I've
          got life perfectly organized. It's the stories, the lessons, the laughs, the rants, and
          all the perfectly imperfect moments that make this journey mine.
        </p>
        <p>
          Family is my heartbeat. I've got three kids &mdash; two grown, and one who thinks she is.
          My momma is still my daily call, even from another city, and we usually end up laughing
          about her husband, BooBoo&hellip; my &ldquo;Boob.&rdquo; And then there's my own husband
          &mdash; the man I love, the man I sometimes have to mom, and the man I can't imagine doing
          life without.
        </p>
        <p>
          Life hasn't always been easy, but God has blessed me more than I can count. I'm learning
          to keep that truth front and center while I grow, learn, and build confidence out loud.
        </p>
        <p>
          I love sunshine, lake days, summer everything, a cold White Claw, a good laugh, and the
          craft of cutting men's hair.
        </p>
        <p>
          So grab a drink, settle in, and welcome to Amber Uncut &mdash; faith, family, and
          hair&hellip; served straight up.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a class="masthead-link" href="/archive/">Read the notes</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
